    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Broken Password Generator\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Fix the bug so the generated password has the same number of characters as the number you enter.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\n**1. Run the app and ask the AI Tutor.**\r\n\r\n* Type a number and click **Generate Password**.\r\n* Look at the bottom of the app to see the *expected* vs *actual* length.\r\n* Ask AI Tutor to walk you through the starter code:\r\n\r\n  * \"Walk me through how this loop works.\"\r\n  * \"How does the stop condition affect how many times it runs?\"\r\n\r\n**2. Find the loop.**\r\n\r\n**3. Focus on the loop variable.**\r\n\r\n* What is the loop variable in this code?\r\n* What number does it start at?\r\n* When does it stop changing?\r\n* How does that affect how many characters get added to the password?\r\n\r\n**4. Fix the bug.**\r\nChange the condition so it runs the correct number of times.\r\n\r\n**5. Test again.**\r\nRun the program again. Do the expected and actual lengths match?\r\n",
